I have proactively supported FTP/Business Change with the investigation, identification and remediation of data-quality issues.

This has included performing analysis of EDI-related FTP fields, identifying data-quality concerns and proposing potential corrective actions.

I also identified schema discrepancies affecting key regulatory fields within the FTP Case Update source data. I highlighted the issue, considered its potential downstream implications and proposed an approach for remediation.

This work demonstrates a proactive approach to data quality by identifying issues within source and transformation layers before they become embedded within curated datasets and downstream reporting.

